WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.712 --> 00:00:11.928
Traditionally, the groom's parents wear blue tones, but you don't have to stick with a stiff, dark navy.

2
00:00:12.264 --> 00:00:22.776
For a more sophisticated, youthful look, try the wide spectrum of blue — sky blue, jade, green, vivid blue, or even intellectual purple or grayish blue.

3
00:00:23.112 --> 00:00:29.232
Adding color specifically to the jeogori, which reflects light onto the face, really brings out the parent's presence.

4
00:00:29.568 --> 00:00:32.688
If you're cool-toned, choose a glossy, vivid blue;

5
00:00:33.024 --> 00:00:42.408
if warm-toned, choose a soft green or khaki. Matching blue to your personal color turns what could look cold into a youthful, energetic secret.
